message: "If you use these pages, please cite this explorer and the bmm paper."
title: "bmm model explorer"
abstract: "Interactive pages for the measurement models in the bmm R package. Move a model's parameters and watch the predicted responses change; the densities are JavaScript ports tested against values that bmm writes."
type: software
